('aa100000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102','aa100000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010','Automating Intake & Documents','Intake forms, passport scanning, and turning supplier confirmation emails into booking records.',2,'published',true,45,'sequential','5c2d70a4-a902-47fa-aaf0-f29fc2eb1562'),
